#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:5
msgid "Save element"
msgstr "保存元素"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:7
msgid ""
"The current `element`_ can be saved from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_ and using "
"the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"当前 `元件 <element_>`_ 可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ "
"中保存，并使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:10
msgid ""
"One `element`_ is only conformed by one file with format ``.elmt``. The "
"``.elmt`` extension is the native extension from QElectroTech `elements`_."
msgstr ""
"一个 `元件 <element_>`_ 只有一个文件符合格式 ``.elmt`` 编辑 ``.elmt`` 扩展是来自 QElectroTech "
"的本地扩展 `元件 <elements_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:14
msgid "Save element from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏中保存元素"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:16
msgid "Select **File > Save** menu item to save the element changes."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 保存** 菜单项以保存元素更改 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:21
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor file menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素编辑器文件菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:23
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:47
msgid ""
"At the case that the opened `element`_ has to overwrite an existing "
"`element`_ or it has to be saved as a new `element`_:"
msgstr ""
"如果打开的 `元件 <element_>`_ 必须覆盖一个现有的 `元件 <element_>`_，或者必须将其保存为一个新的 `元件 "
"<element_>`_:"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:26
msgid ""
"Select **File > Save as** menu item to display the **Save as element** PopUp"
" window."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 另存为** 菜单项以显示 **保存为元素** 弹出窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:31
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:55
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor save as PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素编辑器另存为弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:33
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:57
msgid ""
"Select the `element`_ which should be overwritten or the `category`_ and the"
" name for the new `element`_."
msgstr "选择应当覆盖的 `元件 <element_>`_ 或 `类别 <category_>`_ 和新 `元件 <element_>`_ 的名称。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:34
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:58
msgid ""
"Press the **Save** button to save the `element`_ and close the PopUp window."
msgstr "按 **保存** 按钮保存 `元件 <element_>`_ 并关闭弹出窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:36
msgid ""
"The `element`_ can also be directly saved as a new file in the Hard Disk "
"directory desired:"
msgstr "`元件 <element_>`_ 也可以作为硬盘目录中希望的新文件直接保存："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:38
msgid ""
"Select **File > Save to a file** menu item to display the file system PopUp "
"window."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 保存到文件** 菜单项以显示文件系统 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:39
msgid "Select the directory and the name from the element file."
msgstr "从元件文件中选择目录和名称。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:40
msgid ""
"Press **Save** button to save the `element`_ and close the PopUp window."
msgstr "按 **保存** 按钮保存 `元件 <element_>`_ 并关闭 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:43
msgid "Save element from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏中保存元素"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:45
msgid ""
"Select the icon |document-save| from `toolbar`_ to save the element changes."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择图标 |document-save| 以保存元素更改 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:60
msgid "document-save"
msgstr "文档保存"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:50
msgid ""
"Select the icon |document-save-as| from `toolbar`_ to display the **Save as "
"element** PopUp window."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |document-save-as| 以显示 **保存为元素** popUp 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:61
msgid "document-save-as"
msgstr "文档保存为"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:65
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**"
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:68
msgid "Save element using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键保存元素"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:70
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:72
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + s`` to save the element changes."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + s`` 以保存元素更改。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/element_save.rst:76
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
